                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "channel":  "#gods-vessel-content",
                                         "text":  "âœï¸ New God\u0027s Vessel devotional ready!\n\nðŸ“¹ *{{ $json.video_title }}*\nðŸ”— YouTube: {{ $json.youtube_url }}\nâ±ï¸ Duration: {{ $json.video_duration }}\nðŸ“– Scripture: {{ $json.scripture_references.join(\u0027, \u0027) }}\n\nðŸ™ Content includes:\nâ€¢ {{ $json.prayer_segments.length }} prayer segments\nâ€¢ Scripture graphics and overlays\nâ€¢ Faith apparel merchandise integration\nâ€¢ Daily encouragement and practical application\n\nâœ… Next steps:\n1. Review devotional content and biblical accuracy\n2. Adjust thumbnail for maximum inspiration\n3. Schedule publication for morning devotional time\n4. Prepare Instagram and Facebook cross-posts\n5. Set up merchandise promotion campaign\n\nðŸ’ Ready to encourage believers and drive shop traffic!"
